---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FAQ | CivicConnect" description="Find answers to frequently asked questions about CivicConnect, legal information, and welfare schemes.">
  <div class="container section max-w-4xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-16">
      <span class="badge badge-soft mb-3" data-tone="accent">Support & Clarifications</span>
      <h1 class="text-h1 mb-4">
        Frequently Asked Questions. <span class="text-muted-foreground">Clear answers on how we operate.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Common queries regarding CivicConnect's citations, coverage, and usage.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <!-- Q1 -->
      <details class="group card !p-6 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-ui-sm">
          <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg">What is CivicConnect?</h2>
          <span class="text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-fast">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-small text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-4 border-t border-border mt-4">
          CivicConnect is an AI-powered portal designed to simplify Indian law documents and welfare benefits for the average citizen. By asking questions in natural phrasing, users receive plain-English breakdowns supported by official citation highlights.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Q2 -->
      <details class="group card !p-6 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-ui-sm">
          <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg">Where does the information come from?</h2>
          <span class="text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-fast">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-small text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-4 border-t border-border mt-4">
          All data is retrieved from official government platforms, including central and state gazettes, the National Government Services Portal (services.india.gov.in), ministry websites, and legislative archives. CivicConnect does not write or issue any laws or guidelines.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Q3 -->
      <details class="group card !p-6 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-ui-sm">
          <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg">Can I trust the answers generated by the AI?</h2>
          <span class="text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-fast">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-small text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-4 border-t border-border mt-4">
          We use a strict Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline which prevents the AI from fabricating answers. The assistant can only write summaries using the facts directly present in retrieved official files. Every answer is coupled with citation badges showing the source Act and Section, allowing you to cross-verify the response directly.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Q4 -->
      <details class="group card !p-6 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-ui-sm">
          <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg">Is CivicConnect free to use?</h2>
          <span class="text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-fast">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-small text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-4 border-t border-border mt-4">
          Yes. CivicConnect is completely free, does not mandate user accounts or registrations, and does not display advertisements. It is created as a public-good civic technology project.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- Q5 -->
      <details class="group card !p-6 [&_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring rounded-ui-sm">
          <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg">Does CivicConnect provide legal advice?</h2>
          <span class="text-muted-foreground group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-fast">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" strokeWidth="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="text-small text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed pt-4 border-t border-border mt-4">
          No. CivicConnect is an informational tool. It is not an attorney or judicial officer and does not create an attorney-client relationship. If you are facing formal litigation, police proceedings, or property disputes, please consult a certified advocate or legal aid clinic.
        </div>
      </details>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
